            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "To hold? (teneō, tenēre.) To burst? (rumpō, rumpere.) To warm? (calefaciō, calefacere.) To fill? (impleō, implēre.) To measure? (mētior, mētīrī.) To clap? (plaudō, plaudere.) To cross? (trānseō, trānsīre.) To increase? (augeō, augēre.) To lessen? (minuō, minuere.) To warn? (moneō, monēre.) To deserve? (mereor, merērī.) To correct? (ēmendō, ēmendāre.) To offer? (offerō, offerre.) To watch? (observō, observāre.) To stroll? (spatior, spatiārī.) To dream? (somniō, somniāre.) To push? (pellō, pellere.) To go past? (praetereō, praeterīre.) To make no sound? (sileō, silēre.) To dread? (metuō, metuere.)"
